
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Jarvis IA</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #07111f;
      color: #65e6ff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .carte {
      padding: 35px;
    }
    .orbe {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      border: 3px solid #65e6ff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px #168bff;
      animation: pulsation 2s infinite alternate;
    }
    @keyframes pulsation {
      from { transform: scale(0.95); }
      to {
        transform: scale(1.12);
        box-shadow: 0 0 60px #168bff;
      }
    }
    p { color: #d6f8ff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="carte">
    <h1>JARVIS IA</h1>
    <div class="orbe"></div>
    <h2>Bonjour, je suis Jarvis.</h2>
    <p>Bienvenue sur mon interface officielle.</p>
    <p>Mon interface est en ligne !</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
